<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Bahagian IX Enakmen, selain daripada seksyen 164 dan 165, hendaklah terhenti terpakai bagi Wilayah Persekutuan dan setakat itu hendaklah disifatkan telah dimansuhkan."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_57> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Walaupun Bahagian IX Enakmen dimansuhkan (\"Bahagian termansuh\") segala prosiding di bawah Bahagian termansuh itu, termasuk apa-apa rayuan daripada mana-mana Mahkamah di bawah Bahagian termansuh itu, hendaklah diteruskan seolah-olah Akta ini tidak diluluskan."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_58> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@/~part_VIII> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_58> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "58" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_58> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_58> <https://schema.org/name> "Seksyen 164 Enakmen dalam pemakaiannya bagi"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_58> <https://schema.org/text> "Wilayah Persekutuan adalah dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan \"34 of this Enactment\" dengan perkataan \"28 of the Administration of Islamic Law (Federal Territories) Act 1993\"."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@> .
