<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@/~part_VII__cl_52__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@/~part_VII__cl_52> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/49/msa@> .
